# SKID KIDS: BENCHBOT, the robot the left-over kid builds for the final.
# Three kids' passives in one: arcing throws, a quick wind-up, and a shove
# that beats any other shove. Its special throw is the HOMING POPPER (it
# goes off, then flies home to the robot's hand); its move is the SWEEPER
# (a wall slides from the other team's back wall to the line, tripping
# everyone in its way and dragging every bag over to the robot's side; some
# come out crushed). (2P versus: MOOSE shoves back.)
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat versus 13 1 11 3
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
expect who0 == 13
# the robot's shove beats the big kid's
cheat kid 0 156 100
cheat kid 2 164 80
hold P2DOWN 20
expect n_push == 1
expect kst2 == 5
expect kst0 == 0
# a quick wind-up and an arcing throw
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
cheat kid 0 100 100
cheat kid 2 200 100
cheat give 0 1
hold B 32
wait 3
expect bagst0 == 3
waituntil score0 == 1 60
expect kst2 == 5
# the homing popper goes off and comes home
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
cheat clearbags
cheat stars 0 2
cheat give 0 1
hold B 32
wait 2
expect bagkind0 == 5
waituntil n_boom == 1 120
waituntil held0 == 1 120
# the sweeper
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 2 250 60
cheat kid 3 220 150
cheat freeze 2
cheat loose 270 100
cheat loose 230 120
cheat loose 200 80
cheat stars 0 2
press A
wait 4
press A
expect sweep == 1
expect sweep_x > 290
waituntil sweep == 0 160
expect kst2 == 5
expect kst3 == 5
expect score0 == 3
wait 40
expect loose_r == 0
expect loose_l >= 1
